<ni:///sha-256;RsCHG5AZYpHpAezMbjIkcfmRbKqMNWBVf4Lx1CFZCxA> cascade:noteOrDocumentTypeName "Hospital course Narrative" ;
	cascade:noteOrDocumentTitle "Hospital course, as the clinic holds it" ;
	cascade:workflowStatus "current" ;
	cascade:narrativeText "Admitted on October 2, 2026 with dizziness and a sodium of 123 mmol/L. Hydrochlorothiazide was stopped and fluids restricted; the sodium rose to 134 mmol/L by discharge.\nDischarged home on October 5, 2026 to follow up with his primary care provider within one week." ;
